    <briefdescription>
<para>XOR(...) - Logical Exclusive OR operation (Excel-compatible). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Returns true if an ODD number of arguments are true. For arrays: counts truthy elements.</para>
<para>Examples: XOR(true, false) =&gt; true (1 true) XOR(true, true) =&gt; false (2 trues) XOR(true, true, true) =&gt; true (3 trues) XOR([true, false, true]) =&gt; false (2 trues) </para>
    </detaileddescription>
